  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lalit R Mishra is an 18-year-old student who observes life more than he speaks "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1058
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "about it. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1059
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "He is someone who tries to understand human behavior, emotions, and the "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1060
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "silent problems that people often ignore or fail to express clearly. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1061
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Through writing, he attempts to reflect the thoughts and struggles that exist "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1062
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "within relationships, especially those that are misunderstood or left unspoken. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1063
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "He does not write as an expert or as someone who has all the answers. Instead, "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1064
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "he writes as someone who is still learning — from life, from people, and from "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1065
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "his own experiences. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1066
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "His intention is simple: to create awareness, encourage understanding, and "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1067
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "help people see emotional situations from a more human perspective. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1068
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "He believes that most problems in life are not created by lack of love, but by "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1069
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "lack of understanding — and that healing begins when people start seeing each "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1070
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "other clearly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1071
    }
  ],
